        "translator": "K. M. K. Murthy / Desiraju Hanumanta Rao",
        "text": "While this song that generates longevity and prosperity, and one that is melodious one to all ears is being sung everywhere in streets and king's ways and while those two singers who are experts in singing any kind of music are being appreciated everywhere, Rama has seen them. [1-4-27-28]"
      }
    ],
